(Index: a[i], A[i, j]) Tj
T*
(Slice: a[start:stop:step]) Tj
T*
(Row/column:) Tj
T*
(  - A[i, :] \(row i\)) Tj
T*
(  - A[:, j] \(column j\)) Tj
T*
(Boolean filter: a[a > 0]) Tj
T*
(Conditional replacement: a[a < 0] = 0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Quick reminder: Slices are usually *views* \(not copies\). Use .copy\(\) when needed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
