T*
() Tj
T*
(4\) Core Vectorized Operations) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For arrays of same shape:) Tj
T*
(Addition: C = A + B) Tj
T*
(Subtraction: C = A - B) Tj
T*
(Elementwise multiply: C = A * B) Tj
T*
(Elementwise divide: C = A / B) Tj
T*
(Power: A  p) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(With scalar k:) Tj
T*
(A + k, A - k, A * k, A / k) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Formulae:) Tj
T*
(Elementwise addition: C[i,j] = A[i,j] + B[i,j]) Tj
T*
(Elementwise multiply: C[i,j] = A[i,j]  B[i,j]) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Quick reminder: * is elementwise multiplication, not matrix multiplication.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5\) Broadcasting \(Very Important\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Two shapes are compatible if each trailing dimension is equal or one of them is 1.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Examples:) Tj
T*
(\(m, n\) + \(1, n\) ?) Tj
T*
(\(m, n\) + \(m, 1\) ?) Tj
T*
(\(m, n\) + \(n,\) ?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Formula idea:) Tj
T*
(If needed, dimension 1 is conceptually repeated to match other shape.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Quick reminder: Read shapes from right to left when checking broadcasting.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
