(6\) Aggregations and Statistics) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sum: np.sum\(a\) / a.sum\(\)) Tj
T*
(Mean: np.mean\(a\)) Tj
T*
(Median: np.median\(a\)) Tj
T*
(Standard deviation: np.std\(a\)) Tj
T*
(Variance: np.var\(a\)) Tj
T*
(Min/Max: np.min\(a\), np.max\(a\)) Tj
T*
(Argmin/Argmax: np.argmin\(a\), np.argmax\(a\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Axis usage:) Tj
T*
(axis=0 ? column-wise \(down rows\)) Tj
T*
(axis=1 ? row-wise \(across columns\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Formulae:) Tj
T*
(Mean: ? = \(1/n\) ? xi) Tj
T*
(Variance \(population\): ? = \(1/n\) ? \(xi - ?\)) Tj
T*
(Std dev: ? = ??) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Quick reminder: Always confirm axis to avoid wrong output shape.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7\) Linear Algebra Essentials) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Matrix multiplication: A @ B or np.matmul\(A, B\)) Tj
T*
(Dot product: np.dot\(a, b\)) Tj
T*
(Determinant: np.linalg.det\(A\)) Tj
T*
(Inverse: np.linalg.inv\(A\)) Tj
T*
(Eigenvalues/eigenvectors: np.linalg.eig\(A\)) Tj
T*
(Solve Ax=b: x = np.linalg.solve\(A, b\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Formulae:) Tj
T*
(Dot product: ab = ? ai bi) Tj
T*
(Matrix product: C[i,j] = ? A[i,k]B[k,j]) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Quick reminder: For solving equations, prefer solve over explicit inverse for stability.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8\) Stacking, Splitting, and Joining) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Vertical stack: np.vstack\([A, B]\)) Tj
T*
(Horizontal stack: np.hstack\([A, B]\)) Tj
T*
(Concatenate: np.concatenate\([A, B], axis=0 or 1\)) Tj
T*
(Split: np.split\(a, indices_or_sections\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Quick reminder: Ensure dimensions match except along concatenation axis.) Tj
